# The short (vertical, about 43 s, tools/film.py --layout vertical): already playing, then PERFORM (throw, shut,
# the drop slamming back), dub hold, the effects grid with the riser landing on a downbeat. Every move on a bar's
# downbeat; each `bar` prints the film's time there (the cue sheet for build/film/youtube/short-script.md).
bar 8
wav 10-short.wav
film 10-short.film
bar 8 0. PLAYING: the ripples, the lanes
bar 10 SEL: PERFORM
tap SEL
bar 11 white 7 held: THROW
key w6 down
bar 13 white 9 held: SHUT (under water)
key w6 up
key w8 down
bar 15 white 10 held: DROP
key w8 up
key w9 down
bar 17 let go: the floor slams back
key w9 up
bar 18 SEL off; a tap on REC: DUB HOLD
tap SEL
tap REC
bar 20 REC: let go
tap REC
bar 21 REC held: the effects grid
press REC
bar 22 TAPE STOP
key w2 down
bar 23 STUTTER
key w2 up
key w12 down
bar 24 SIREN
key w12 up
key w14 down
bar 26 RISER
key w14 up
key w15 down
bar 28 let go: the riser lands
key w15 up
release REC
bar 31 END
filmstop
wavstop
